query subheading is:
    the subheading of which good is which code.

query heading is:
    the heading of which good is which heading.

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Watch straps, bands and bracelets (heading 9113)
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

% NY N352742 (September 2025): a band for a smart watch, 75 percent rubber
% (HNBR) with nylon, titanium and stainless steel, not entered with the
% watch.
% CBP: the Peakform band -> 9113.90
scenario ny_n352742 is, as stated in ruling NY N352742:
    the kind of the Peakform band is watch band,
        confer "is a watch band designed to fit a smart device".
    the Peakform band is a manufactured article,
        confer "is a watch band designed to fit a smart device".
    the Peakform band is wholly or mainly of rubber,
        confer "the material composition of the watch strap is 75% Hydrogenated Nitrile Butadiene Rubber (HNBR)".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Peakform band is 9113.90"].

% NY N263082 (April 2015): replacement bands for smart watches, of nylon,
% and of polyurethane and leather, all with stainless steel buckles.
% CBP: the Woven watch band -> 9113.90; the Corsica watch band -> 9113.90
scenario ny_n263082 is, as stated in ruling NY N263082:
    the kind of the Woven watch band is watch band,
        confer "The Woven watch band, designed for the Apple smart watch, is composed of nylon".
    the Woven watch band is a manufactured article,
        confer "The Woven watch band, designed for the Apple smart watch, is composed of nylon".
    the Woven watch band is wholly or mainly of nylon,
        confer "The Woven watch band, designed for the Apple smart watch, is composed of nylon".
    the kind of the Corsica watch band is watch band,
        confer "The Corsica watch band, designed for the Apple smart watch, is composed of polyurethane and leather".
    the Corsica watch band is a manufactured article,
        confer "The Corsica watch band, designed for the Apple smart watch, is composed of polyurethane and leather".
    the Corsica watch band is wholly or mainly of leather,
        confer "is composed of polyurethane and leather".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Woven watch band is 9113.90", "the subheading of the Corsica watch band is 9113.90"].

% HQ H276954 (January 2017): bands for the Apple Watch, of leather, of
% plastics and of stainless steel mesh; the importer's claim that they are
% parts of the watch of heading 8517 is rejected.
% CBP: the Modal band -> 9113.90; the Modal Sports band -> 9113.90; the
% Platinum band -> 9113.20
scenario hq_h276954 is, as stated in ruling HQ H276954:
    the kind of the Modal band is watch band,
        confer "The “Modal Band” is a pebbled leather band made of top grain leather with a metal buckle".
    the Modal band is a manufactured article,
        confer "The “Modal Band” is a pebbled leather band made of top grain leather with a metal buckle".
    the Modal band is wholly or mainly of leather,
        confer "is a pebbled leather band made of top grain leather".
    the Modal band is claimed to belong to parts of apparatus of heading 8517,
        confer "it is your position that the Bands are appropriately classified as parts of the Apple Watch in heading 8517 HTSUS".
    the claim that the Modal band belongs to parts of apparatus of heading 8517 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "they serve solely to keep the Apple Watch affixed to the user’s wrist in the same manner that watch bands affix traditional watches to users’ wrists".
    the kind of the Modal Sports band is watch band,
        confer "The “Modal Sports Band” is a plastic watch band".
    the Modal Sports band is a manufactured article,
        confer "The “Modal Sports Band” is a plastic watch band".
    the Modal Sports band is made of plastics,
        confer "is a plastic watch band with a thermoplastic polyurethane bumper".
    the Modal Sports band is claimed to belong to parts of apparatus of heading 8517,
        confer "it is your position that the Bands are appropriately classified as parts of the Apple Watch in heading 8517 HTSUS".
    the claim that the Modal Sports band belongs to parts of apparatus of heading 8517 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "they serve solely to keep the Apple Watch affixed to the user’s wrist in the same manner that watch bands affix traditional watches to users’ wrists".
    the kind of the Platinum band is watch band,
        confer "The “Platinum Band” is a band made of stainless steel metal mesh".
    the Platinum band is a manufactured article,
        confer "The “Platinum Band” is a band made of stainless steel metal mesh".
    the metal of the Platinum band is stainless steel,
        confer "is a band made of stainless steel metal mesh".
    the Platinum band is claimed to belong to parts of apparatus of heading 8517,
        confer "it is your position that the Bands are appropriately classified as parts of the Apple Watch in heading 8517 HTSUS".
    the claim that the Platinum band belongs to parts of apparatus of heading 8517 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "they serve solely to keep the Apple Watch affixed to the user’s wrist in the same manner that watch bands affix traditional watches to users’ wrists".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Modal band is 9113.90", "the subheading of the Modal Sports band is 9113.90", "the subheading of the Platinum band is 9113.20"].

% NY 856783 (October 1990): nylon watch straps.
% CBP: strap BW/F24 -> 9113.90
scenario ny_856783 is, as stated in ruling NY 856783:
    the kind of strap BW/F24 is watch strap,
        confer "A sample nylon watch strap, reference number BW/F24, was submitted".
    strap BW/F24 is a manufactured article,
        confer "A sample nylon watch strap, reference number BW/F24, was submitted".
    strap BW/F24 is wholly or mainly of nylon,
        confer "all of which are nylon watch straps".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of strap BW/F24 is 9113.90"].

% NY 872221 (March 1992): a man's leather watch strap.
% CBP: the Crocostyle strap -> 9113.90
scenario ny_872221 is, as stated in ruling NY 872221:
    the kind of the Crocostyle strap is watch strap,
        confer "is a man's leather watch strap packaged in a plastic container".
    the Crocostyle strap is a manufactured article,
        confer "is a man's leather watch strap packaged in a plastic container".
    the Crocostyle strap is wholly or mainly of leather,
        confer "is a man's leather watch strap".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Crocostyle strap is 9113.90"].

% NY N292811 (January 2018): a watch strap of leather and denim; the
% leather gives it its essential character (GRI 3(b)).
% CBP: the leather/denim strap -> 9113.90
scenario ny_n292811 is, as stated in ruling NY N292811:
    the kind of the leather/denim strap is watch strap,
        confer "The product under consideration is identified as a watch strap that is made to be attached to a watch head".
    the leather/denim strap is a manufactured article,
        confer "The product under consideration is identified as a watch strap".
    the leather/denim strap is a composite good,
        confer "The watch strap in question is a composite article that is comprised of leather and denim material".
    the leather of the strap is a component of the leather/denim strap,
        confer "The leather is on the inside of the strap".
    the denim of the strap is a component of the leather/denim strap,
        confer "the denim is stitched to the outer side".
    the leather of the strap is wholly or mainly of leather,
        confer "The leather is on the inside of the strap".
    the denim of the strap is wholly or mainly of denim,
        confer "the denim is stitched to the outer side".
    the essential character of the leather/denim strap is given by the leather of the strap,
        according to CBP, confer "it is the opinion of this office that the leather components impart the essential character to the watch strap".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the leather/denim strap is 9113.90"].

% HQ 951467 (June 1992): leather and plastic watch straps with spring bars
% inserted; the straps give the composite good its essential character.
% CBP: the leather strap with spring bars -> 9113.90; the plastic strap
% with spring bars -> 9113.90
scenario hq_951467 is, as stated in ruling HQ 951467:
    the kind of the leather strap with spring bars is watch strap,
        confer "Two were plastic watch straps and five were leather watch straps, all with spring-bars inserted in the ends of both sections of each strap".
    the leather strap with spring bars is a manufactured article,
        confer "five were leather watch straps".
    the leather strap with spring bars is a composite good,
        confer "Watch strap and spring-bar combinations are composite goods".
    the leather strap is a component of the leather strap with spring bars,
        confer "five were leather watch straps".
    the spring bars of the leather strap is a component of the leather strap with spring bars,
        confer "all with spring-bars inserted in the ends of both sections of each strap".
    the leather strap is wholly or mainly of leather,
        confer "five were leather watch straps".
    the essential character of the leather strap with spring bars is given by the leather strap,
        according to CBP, confer "the essential character of the subject composite good is derived from the leather or plastic watch straps".
    the kind of the plastic strap with spring bars is watch strap,
        confer "Two were plastic watch straps".
    the plastic strap with spring bars is a manufactured article,
        confer "Two were plastic watch straps".
    the plastic strap with spring bars is a composite good,
        confer "Watch strap and spring-bar combinations are composite goods".
    the plastic strap is a component of the plastic strap with spring bars,
        confer "Two were plastic watch straps".
    the spring bars of the plastic strap is a component of the plastic strap with spring bars,
        confer "all with spring-bars inserted in the ends of both sections of each strap".
    the plastic strap is made of plastics,
        confer "Two were plastic watch straps".
    the essential character of the plastic strap with spring bars is given by the plastic strap,
        according to CBP, confer "the essential character of the subject composite good is derived from the leather or plastic watch straps".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the leather strap with spring bars is 9113.90", "the subheading of the plastic strap with spring bars is 9113.90"].

% HQ 957242 (March 1995): a band of leather and nylon webbing; the leather
% gives it its essential character.
% CBP: the leather/nylon band -> 9113.90
scenario hq_957242 is, as stated in ruling HQ 957242:
    the kind of the leather/nylon band is watch band,
        confer "the classification of a leather watch band and a combination leather/nylon watch band".
    the leather/nylon band is a manufactured article,
        confer "a combination leather/nylon watch band".
    the leather/nylon band is a composite good,
        confer "the leather/textile watch band is a composite good consisting of leather and textile material".
    the leather of the band is a component of the leather/nylon band,
        confer "All submitted straps contain between 60 and 70 percent leather".
    the nylon webbing of the band is a component of the leather/nylon band,
        confer "contain between 25 and 35 percent nylon webbing".
    the leather of the band is wholly or mainly of leather,
        confer "All submitted straps contain between 60 and 70 percent leather".
    the nylon webbing of the band is wholly or mainly of nylon,
        confer "contain between 25 and 35 percent nylon webbing".
    the essential character of the leather/nylon band is given by the leather of the band,
        according to CBP, confer "We find that the leather portion of the band imparts the article's essential character".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the leather/nylon band is 9113.90"].

% NY 884636 (April 1993): an unfinished part of a watch bracelet of base
% metal, a "stick".
% CBP: the stick -> 9113.20
scenario ny_884636 is, as stated in ruling NY 884636:
    the kind of the stick is watch strap part,
        confer "is an unfinished part of a watch bracelet known in the trade as a \"stick.\"".
    the stick is a manufactured article,
        confer "is an unfinished part of a watch bracelet".
    the metal of the stick is base metal,
        confer "The stick is made of a base metal".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the stick is 9113.20"].

% HQ 965207 (March 2002): Santos de Cartier watches, cases of base metal
% with gold bezels, and their bracelets of stainless steel inlaid with gold
% screws. The case is not wholly of precious metal (note 2): 9102; the
% bracelet imported alone is of base metal inlaid with precious metal,
% that is metal clad with precious metal (Chapter 71 note 7): 9113.10.
% CBP: watch model W20030C4 -> 9102.11; watch model W20036R3 -> 9102.21;
% the bracelet imported alone -> 9113.10
scenario hq_965207 is, as stated in ruling HQ 965207:
    the kind of watch model W20030C4 is wrist watch,
        confer "The Santos de Cartier line includes various types of watches of stainless steel".
    watch model W20030C4 is a manufactured article,
        confer "The Santos de Cartier line includes various types of watches of stainless steel".
    watch model W20030C4 is electrically operated,
        confer "Models W20030C4, W2003R73, W20011C4 watches have battery operated quartz movements with seven jewels".
    watch model W20030C4 has a mechanical display,
        confer "wrist watches, electrically operated, whether or not incorporating a stop watch facility: with mechanical display only".
    the case metal of watch model W20030C4 is stainless steel,
        confer "The watches have base metal cases with 18-carat gold (circular or square) bezels".
    the kind of watch model W20036R3 is wrist watch,
        confer "The Santos de Cartier line includes various types of watches of stainless steel".
    watch model W20036R3 is a manufactured article,
        confer "The Santos de Cartier line includes various types of watches of stainless steel".
    watch model W20036R3 has a mechanical movement,
        confer "Model W20036R3 has an automatic winding mechanical movement with 17 jewels".
    watch model W20036R3 has automatic winding,
        confer "Model W20036R3 has an automatic winding mechanical movement with 17 jewels".
    the case metal of watch model W20036R3 is stainless steel,
        confer "The watches have base metal cases with 18-carat gold (circular or square) bezels".
    the kind of the Santos bracelet is watch bracelet,
        confer "Occasionally, the bracelets will be imported separately as replacements for damaged bracelets".
    the Santos bracelet is a manufactured article,
        confer "Occasionally, the bracelets will be imported separately as replacements for damaged bracelets".
    the metal of the Santos bracelet is stainless steel,
        confer "are composed of stainless steel and inlaid with 18-carat gold".
    the Santos bracelet is inlaid with gold alloy,
        confer "are composed of stainless steel and inlaid with 18-carat gold".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of watch model W20030C4 is 9102.11", "the subheading of watch model W20036R3 is 9102.21", "the subheading of the Santos bracelet is 9113.10"].

% NY K88403 (August 2004): an analog watch head sold with two frame and
% strap assemblies; CBP classifies the additional gold plated metal frame
% and metal band apart from the watch, by the metal band (GRI 3(b)).
% CBP: the watch with leather strap -> 9102.11; the additional frame and
% band -> 9113.20
scenario ny_k88403 is, as stated in ruling NY K88403:
    the kind of the watch with leather strap is wrist watch,
        confer "The applicable subheading for the watch with base metal frame and leather strap will be 9102.11.45".
    the watch with leather strap is a manufactured article,
        confer "The watch head is an analog watch with no jewels in the movement".
    the watch with leather strap is electrically operated,
        confer "wrist watches, electrically operated, with mechanical display only".
    the watch with leather strap has a mechanical display,
        confer "The watch head is an analog watch with no jewels in the movement".
    the kind of the additional frame and band is watch band,
        confer "the other metal frame is attached to a metal watch band".
    the additional frame and band is a manufactured article,
        confer "the additional gold plated metal frame and metal band assembly".
    the additional frame and band is a composite good,
        confer "We consider the gold plated metal frame and metal watch band assembly to be a composite good under GRI 3".
    the metal band is a component of the additional frame and band,
        confer "the other metal frame is attached to a metal watch band".
    the gold plated frame is a component of the additional frame and band,
        confer "the additional gold plated metal frame and metal band assembly".
    the metal of the metal band is base metal,
        confer "watch straps, watch bands and watch bracelets, and parts thereof; of base metal, whether or not gold- or silver-plated".
    the essential character of the additional frame and band is given by the metal band,
        according to CBP, confer "The metal watch band imparts the essential character to the composite good".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the watch with leather strap is 9102.11", "the subheading of the additional frame and band is 9113.20"].

% NY I89112 (January 2003): an LCD watch sold with four nylon bands, which
% CBP classifies with the watch (Additional U.S. note 2); an analog watch
% sold with an additional steel band and a leather strap, which CBP
% classifies apart.
% CBP: the Mickey Mouse LCD watch -> 9102.12; the nylon bands -> 9102.12;
% the Men's Interchangeable watch -> 9102.11; the additional steel band ->
% 9113.20; the leather strap -> 9113.90
scenario ny_i89112 is, as stated in ruling NY I89112:
    the kind of the Mickey Mouse LCD watch is wrist watch,
        confer "is a wrist watch that will be imported and sold packaged in a blister display pack with four interchangeable nylon bands".
    the Mickey Mouse LCD watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "The submitted Mickey Mouse Interchangeable Body Parts LCD Watch is a wrist watch".
    the Mickey Mouse LCD watch is electrically operated,
        confer "The watch contains a battery operated electronic watch movement with a liquid crystal display (LCD)".
    the Mickey Mouse LCD watch has an opto-electronic display,
        confer "The watch contains a battery operated electronic watch movement with a liquid crystal display (LCD)".
    the kind of the nylon bands is watch band,
        confer "with four interchangeable nylon bands".
    the nylon bands is a manufactured article,
        confer "with four interchangeable nylon bands".
    the nylon bands is wholly or mainly of nylon,
        confer "with four interchangeable nylon bands".
    the nylon bands is entered with the Mickey Mouse LCD watch,
        confer "straps, bands or bracelets entered with watches of subheading 9102.12.80 and classifiable therewith pursuant to additional U.S. note 2 to this chapter".
    the kind of the Men's Interchangeable watch is wrist watch,
        confer "The Men’s Interchangeable Quartz Analog Watch is a wrist watch".
    the Men's Interchangeable watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "The Men’s Interchangeable Quartz Analog Watch is a wrist watch".
    the Men's Interchangeable watch is electrically operated,
        confer "The watch is a men’s battery operated quartz analog wrist watch".
    the Men's Interchangeable watch has a mechanical display,
        confer "has a black dial with silver tone hour, minute and second hands".
    the case metal of the Men's Interchangeable watch is stainless steel,
        confer "wrist watch in a stainless steel case".
    the kind of the additional steel band is watch band,
        confer "features an additional two-tone gold-plated stainless steel band".
    the additional steel band is a manufactured article,
        confer "features an additional two-tone gold-plated stainless steel band".
    the metal of the additional steel band is stainless steel,
        confer "features an additional two-tone gold-plated stainless steel band".
    the kind of the leather strap is watch strap,
        confer "and a black leather watch strap".
    the leather strap is a manufactured article,
        confer "and a black leather watch strap".
    the leather strap is wholly or mainly of leather,
        confer "and a black leather watch strap".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Mickey Mouse LCD watch is 9102.12", "the subheading of the nylon bands is 9102.12", "the subheading of the Men's Interchangeable watch is 9102.11", "the subheading of the additional steel band is 9113.20", "the subheading of the leather strap is 9113.90"].

% NY N342931 (October 2024): a box set of a quartz analog watch with a
% stainless steel case and bracelet, and an additional leather strap, all
% classified with the watch (Additional U.S. note 2).
% CBP: the box set watch -> 9102.11; the additional leather strap ->
% 9102.11 (with the set)
scenario ny_n342931 is, as stated in ruling NY N342931:
    the kind of the box set watch is wrist watch,
        confer "Each box set will consist of a quartz analog wrist watch with a stainless steel case".
    the box set watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "Each box set will consist of a quartz analog wrist watch with a stainless steel case".
    the box set watch is electrically operated,
        confer "Wrist watches, electrically operated, whether or not incorporating a stop watch facility: With mechanical display only".
    the box set watch has a mechanical display,
        confer "Each box set will consist of a quartz analog wrist watch".
    the case metal of the box set watch is stainless steel,
        confer "with a stainless steel case, stainless steel bracelet".
    the kind of the additional leather strap is watch strap,
        confer "The first box set will include an additional unattached leather strap".
    the additional leather strap is a manufactured article,
        confer "The first box set will include an additional unattached leather strap".
    the additional leather strap is wholly or mainly of leather,
        confer "The first box set will include an additional unattached leather strap".
    the additional leather strap is entered with the box set watch,
        confer "Each box set will be imported in a single retail package".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the box set watch is 9102.11", "the subheading of the additional leather strap is 9102.11"].

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Watch cases and parts (headings 9111, 9114)
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

% NY N170879 (July 2011): watch cases of precious metal, of base metal
% plated and not plated, other cases; dials; hands and stems; bracelets of
% base metal.
% CBP: the gold cases -> 9111.10; the plated cases -> 9111.20; the steel
% cases -> 9111.20; the dials -> 9114.30; the hands -> 9114.90; the stems ->
% 9114.90; the metal bracelets -> 9113.20
scenario ny_n170879 is, as stated in ruling NY N170879:
    the kind of the gold cases is watch case,
        confer "The applicable subheading for watch cases of precious metal or metal clad with precious metal will be 9111.10.00".
    the gold cases is a manufactured article,
        confer "Watch cases will be imported from China or from other countries".
    the metal of the gold cases is gold,
        confer "watch cases of precious metal or metal clad with precious metal".
    the kind of the plated cases is watch case,
        confer "The applicable subheading for watch cases of base metal which are gold- or silver-plated will be 9111.20.20".
    the plated cases is a manufactured article,
        confer "Watch cases will be imported from China or from other countries".
    the metal of the plated cases is base metal,
        confer "watch cases of base metal which are gold- or silver-plated".
    the kind of the dials is dial,
        confer "Dials, hands and stems and other watch parts will also be imported from Switzerland".
    the dials is a manufactured article,
        confer "Dials, hands and stems and other watch parts will also be imported from Switzerland".
    the kind of the hands is watch hand,
        confer "Dials, hands and stems and other watch parts will also be imported from Switzerland".
    the hands is a manufactured article,
        confer "Dials, hands and stems and other watch parts will also be imported from Switzerland".
    the kind of the stems is stem,
        confer "Dials, hands and stems and other watch parts will also be imported from Switzerland".
    the stems is a manufactured article,
        confer "Dials, hands and stems and other watch parts will also be imported from Switzerland".
    the kind of the metal bracelets is watch bracelet,
        confer "Metal watch bracelets may be sourced from China".
    the metal bracelets is a manufactured article,
        confer "Metal watch bracelets may be sourced from China".
    the metal of the metal bracelets is base metal,
        confer "The applicable subheading for the base metal watch bracelets".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the gold cases is 9111.10", "the subheading of the plated cases is 9111.20", "the subheading of the dials is 9114.30", "the subheading of the hands is 9114.90", "the subheading of the stems is 9114.90", "the subheading of the metal bracelets is 9113.20"].

% NY N329214 (November 2022): the aluminum housing, two buttons and the
% steel bezel of a health tracking watch, which CBP classifies as other
% watch parts. The importer's claim to Chapter 85 is rejected.
% CBP: the housing -> 9114.90; the buttons -> 9114.90; the bezel -> 9114.90
% DISAGREES for the housing and the bezel: the model reads Additional U.S.
% note 1(b) ("cases" embraces the housings for movements and the parts that
% complete them) as HQ 968150 reads it for a bezel, so the housing is a
% case of base metal (9111.20) and the bezel a part of a case (9111.90).
scenario ny_n329214 is, as stated in ruling NY N329214:
    the kind of the housing is watch case,
        confer "The housing holds the workings of the Masimo W1 Health Tracking Watch".
    the housing is a manufactured article,
        confer "The housing is made of aluminum that has been machined and anodized".
    the metal of the housing is aluminum,
        confer "The housing is made of aluminum that has been machined and anodized".
    the housing is claimed to belong to parts of the goods of chapter 85,
        confer "You suggested classification for the housing, two buttons and bezel of the Masimo W1 Health Tracking Watch in Chapter 85".
    the claim that the housing belongs to parts of the goods of chapter 85 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "As such, classification within Chapter 85 would be inapplicable".
    the kind of the buttons is watch part,
        confer "will have two buttons that attach to the housing".
    the buttons is a manufactured article,
        confer "The buttons for the watch are made of aluminum that has been machined and anodized".
    the buttons is claimed to belong to parts of the goods of chapter 85,
        confer "You suggested classification for the housing, two buttons and bezel of the Masimo W1 Health Tracking Watch in Chapter 85".
    the claim that the buttons belongs to parts of the goods of chapter 85 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "As such, classification within Chapter 85 would be inapplicable".
    the kind of the bezel is bezel,
        confer "The bezel of the watch is made of stainless steel that has a physical vapor deposition (PVD) coating".
    the bezel is a manufactured article,
        confer "The bezel of the watch is made of stainless steel".
    the bezel is claimed to belong to parts of the goods of chapter 85,
        confer "You suggested classification for the housing, two buttons and bezel of the Masimo W1 Health Tracking Watch in Chapter 85".
    the claim that the bezel belongs to parts of the goods of chapter 85 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "As such, classification within Chapter 85 would be inapplicable".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the housing is 9111.20", "the subheading of the buttons is 9114.90", "the subheading of the bezel is 9111.90"].

