% HQ 968150 (May 2006): watch heads for ladies' wrist watches, the case of
% sterling silver but the bezel of steel: the case is not wholly of
% precious metal (note 2), so heading 9102.
% CBP: the T4 Madison watch -> 9102.11
scenario hq_968150 is, as stated in ruling HQ 968150:
    the kind of the T4 Madison watch is wrist watch,
        confer "The articles at issue are actually watch heads for ladies wrist watches".
    the T4 Madison watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "The articles at issue are actually watch heads for ladies wrist watches".
    the T4 Madison watch is electrically operated,
        confer "The watches are made in Switzerland and are electrically operated (battery powered)".
    the T4 Madison watch has a mechanical display,
        confer "Wrist watches, electrically operated, whether or not incorporating a stop watch facility: With mechanical display only".
    the case metal of the T4 Madison watch is silver alloy,
        confer "he case is made of solid sterling silver".
    the case of the T4 Madison watch has a part of steel,
        confer "Only the bezel (or front) is made of a non-precious metal, specifically steel".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the T4 Madison watch is 9102.11"].

% NY E83962 (July 1999): a quartz analog wrist watch in a gold-plated case
% with a stainless steel back (plating is no precious metal).
% CBP: the Birthstone Watch -> 9102.11
scenario ny_e83962 is, as stated in ruling NY E83962:
    the kind of the Birthstone Watch is wrist watch,
        confer "is a women’s battery operated quartz analog gold-plated wrist watch".
    the Birthstone Watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "A sample of the Birthstone Watch was submitted".
    the Birthstone Watch is electrically operated,
        confer "is a women’s battery operated quartz analog gold-plated wrist watch".
    the Birthstone Watch has a mechanical display,
        confer "The watch has a round dial with gold hour, minute and second hands".
    the case of the Birthstone Watch has a part of stainless steel,
        confer "in a shiny gold-plated case with a stainless steel back".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Birthstone Watch is 9102.11"].

% NY N248589 (January 2014): an LED wrist watch with a silicone band.
% CBP: the Touch LED Watch -> 9102.12; its strap -> 9102.12
scenario ny_n248589 is, as stated in ruling NY N248589:
    the kind of the Touch LED Watch is wrist watch,
        confer "It is a wrist watch with a silicon watch band".
    the Touch LED Watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "Item 957355 is described as a Touch LED Watch".
    the Touch LED Watch is electrically operated,
        confer "The watch requires a button cell battery which is included".
    the Touch LED Watch has an opto-electronic display,
        confer "the time is displayed by red light emitting diodes (LEDs)".
    the kind of the silicone band is watch band,
        confer "It is a wrist watch with a silicon watch band".
    the silicone band is a manufactured article,
        confer "It is a wrist watch with a silicon watch band".
    the silicone band is made of plastics,
        confer "with a silicon watch band".
    the silicone band is entered with the Touch LED Watch,
        confer "The applicable subheading for the strap for the Touch LED Watch will be 9102.12.40".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Touch LED Watch is 9102.12", "the subheading of the silicone band is 9102.12"].

% NY L80530 (November 2004): a digital spy watch with a telescope and a
% night vision beam; the claim that it is a toy is rejected.
% CBP: the XP-6 Spy Watch -> 9102.12
scenario ny_l80530 is, as stated in ruling NY L80530:
    the kind of the XP-6 Spy Watch is wrist watch,
        confer "is a battery-operated digital combination wrist watch and telescope".
    the XP-6 Spy Watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "The submitted XP-6 Spy Watch is a battery-operated digital combination wrist watch and telescope".
    the XP-6 Spy Watch is electrically operated,
        confer "is a battery-operated digital combination wrist watch".
    the XP-6 Spy Watch has an opto-electronic display,
        confer "The watch features a liquid crystal display (LCD)".
    the XP-6 Spy Watch is claimed to belong to toys of chapter 95,
        confer "You have indicated in your letter that you believe the XP-6 Spy Watch is a toy".
    the claim that the XP-6 Spy Watch belongs to toys of chapter 95 is rejected,
        according to CBP, confer "the XP-6 Spy Watch is a working, functional watch classifiable in Chapter 91 as a watch".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the XP-6 Spy Watch is 9102.12"].

% NY N303322 (March 2019): an automatic wrist watch with a base metal case.
% CBP: the Miyota 8217 watch -> 9102.21
scenario ny_n303322 is, as stated in ruling NY N303322:
    the kind of the Miyota 8217 watch is wrist watch,
        confer "is identified as an automatic wrist watch with a Japan Miyota 8217 movement".
    the Miyota 8217 watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "is identified as an automatic wrist watch".
    the Miyota 8217 watch has a mechanical movement,
        confer "The wrist watch features a mechanical self winding movement".
    the Miyota 8217 watch has automatic winding,
        confer "The wrist watch features a mechanical self winding movement".
    the Miyota 8217 watch has a mechanical display,
        confer "The watch has a round dial with a second hand, a minute hand, an hour hand and a 24 hour hand".
    the case metal of the Miyota 8217 watch is base metal,
        confer "a base metal case with a stainless steel back".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Miyota 8217 watch is 9102.21"].

% HQ 955278 (November 1993): a Seiko Kinetic watch, whose movement turns
% the motion of the arm into electrical energy: an electrically operated
% watch, not one with automatic winding.
% CBP: the Kinetic watch -> 9102.11
scenario hq_955278 is, as stated in ruling HQ 955278:
    the kind of the Kinetic watch is wrist watch,
        confer "The Seiko Kinetic quartz analogue automatic wrist watch (model no. SHF032) is a product of Japan".
    the Kinetic watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "is a product of Japan".
    the Kinetic watch is electrically operated,
        confer "The AGS converts the rotational energy generated by the movement of the arm of the watch wearer into electrical energy, and thus powers the watch".
    the Kinetic watch has a mechanical display,
        confer "the second hand starts moving at two-second intervals".
    the Kinetic watch has automatic winding,
        confer "Seiko Kinetic quartz analogue automatic wrist watch".
    the case of the Kinetic watch has a part of steel,
        confer "in a gold-plated case, with a steel back".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Kinetic watch is 9102.11"].

