    the kind of the Metropolitan+ Watch is wrist watch,
        confer "is a battery-operated, quartz analog wristwatch equipped with an accelerometer sensor".
    the Metropolitan+ Watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "is a battery-operated, quartz analog wristwatch".
    the Metropolitan+ Watch is electrically operated,
        confer "is a battery-operated, quartz analog wristwatch".
    the Metropolitan+ Watch has a mechanical display,
        confer "is a battery-operated, quartz analog wristwatch".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the Metropolitan+ Watch is 9102.11"].

% NY N343557 (November 2024): a quartz analog watch head fastened to a neck
% choker; the watch head gives the composite good its essential character.
% CBP: the watch choker -> 9102.91
scenario ny_n343557 is, as stated in ruling NY N343557:
    the watch choker is a manufactured article,
        confer "The product under consideration is identified as a watch choker".
    the watch choker is a composite good,
        confer "The watch choker is a composite article that is comprised of a watch head and a neck choker".
    the watch head of the choker is a component of the watch choker,
        confer "quartz analog watch head incorporated in a neck choker".
    the neck choker is a component of the watch choker,
        confer "The choker will be made from leather wrapped in a microfiber".
    the kind of the watch head of the choker is watch head,
        confer "quartz analog watch head incorporated in a neck choker".
    the watch head of the choker is electrically operated,
        confer "quartz analog watch head incorporated in a neck choker".
    the watch head of the choker has a mechanical display,
        confer "The watch head features a rectangular dial with a second hand, a minute hand, and an hour hand".
    the case metal of the watch head of the choker is stainless steel,
        confer "The watch head is made of stainless steel".
    the neck choker is wholly or mainly of leather,
        confer "The choker will be made from leather wrapped in a microfiber".
    the essential character of the watch choker is given by the watch head of the choker,
        according to CBP, confer "it is the opinion of this office that the watch head imparts the essential character to the composite article".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the watch choker is 9102.91"].

% NY N233953 (October 2012): a pendant watch on a chain bracelet, worn on
% the wrist, and a pendant watch on a necklace chain.
% CBP: the bracelet wrist watch -> 9102.11; the necklace watch -> 9102.91
scenario ny_n233953 is, as stated in ruling NY N233953:
    the kind of the bracelet wrist watch is wrist watch,
        confer "The bracelet wrist watch is a gold-plated base metal pendent watch".
    the bracelet wrist watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "The bracelet wrist watch is a gold-plated base metal pendent watch".
    the bracelet wrist watch is electrically operated,
        confer "The watch is a battery operated analog watch with a quartz movement with no jewels".
    the bracelet wrist watch has a mechanical display,
        confer "The watch is a battery operated analog watch".
    the case metal of the bracelet wrist watch is base metal,
        confer "is a gold-plated base metal pendent watch".
    the kind of the necklace watch is pendant watch,
        confer "The necklace watch is a gold-plated pendent watch".
    the necklace watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "The necklace watch is a gold-plated pendent watch".
    the necklace watch is electrically operated,
        confer "The watch is a battery operated analog watch with a quartz movement with no jewels".
    the necklace watch has a mechanical display,
        confer "The watch is a battery operated analog watch".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the bracelet wrist watch is 9102.11", "the subheading of the necklace watch is 9102.91"].

