% CBP: the Apple Watch -> 8517.62 (outside the model)
scenario hq_h260060 is, as stated in ruling HQ H260060:
    the kind of the Apple Watch is smart watch,
        confer "The Apple Watch is a battery-operated, wearable electronic device in the form of a wrist-watch".
    the Apple Watch is a manufactured article,
        confer "The Apple Watch is a battery-operated, wearable electronic device".
    the Apple Watch is electrically operated,
        confer "The Apple Watch is a battery-operated, wearable electronic device".
    the Apple Watch has an opto-electronic display,
        confer "active-matrix organic light-emitting diode (AMOLED) display".
    the Apple Watch is claimed to belong to transmission apparatus of heading 8517,
        confer "By application of GRI 3(b), the Apple Watch wearable electronic device is classified in heading 8517, HTSUS".
    the claim that the Apple Watch belongs to transmission apparatus of heading 8517 is accepted,
        according to CBP, confer "By application of GRI 3(b), the Apple Watch wearable electronic device is classified in heading 8517, HTSUS".
    subheading expects answers [].

